<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 3-, 12-mth discount T-bills Monday.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 3-, 12-mth discount T-bills Monday.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer on Monday two discount T-bill issues with total par value of 80 billion levs, and maturities of three and 12 months respectively, central bank figures showed.</p>
<p>The issues are offered with no minimum acceptable price set in advance.</p>
<p>Details of the offers follow:</p>
<p> Issue number	  BG3040897004    BG3040997002</p>
<p> Maturity		three months    12 months</p>
<p> Par value	     40 bln levs     40 bln levs</p>
<p> Auction date	  July 7	    July 7</p>
<p> Issue date	    July 9	    July 9</p>
<p> Maturity date	 July 8	    July 8, 1998</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
